Hi all,

 This posting is to let you know that Euphoric, an Oric emulator, is now
 available on the net.

 The Oric 1 and Oric Atmos are old favorite 8 bit computers. This first
 public release features : Oric 1 and Atmos ROMs supported, screen aspect
 rigorously identical to the real computers (Hires and Text modes, with
 redefinable characters), loading and saving of files from disk, and
 an utility to transfer your programs from tapes to disk using a sound
 card.

